<title>UK: Logica in 14 mln stg Polaris insurance deal.</title>
<headline>Logica in 14 mln stg Polaris insurance deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British software group Logica Plc said on Friday it had signed an applications management deal with Polaris UK Ltd.</p>
<p>Logica said the deal was worth more than 14 million stg over seven years. Logica said it would manage the development and support of the Polaris insurance software.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
